libfguid
------------------------------------------
libfguid is a library for GUID/UUID data types.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libfguid-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid1-20260521-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfguid

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfguid/archive/refs/tags/20260521.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfguid-20260521-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfguid-20260521-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfguid-20260521-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfguid-20260521-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfguid1-20260521-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfguid-devel-20260521-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfguid)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfguid.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfguid/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfguid/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libfguid/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libfguid/README

(libfguid1)
  /usr/bin/cygfguid-1.dll

(libfguid-devel)
  /usr/include/libfguid.h
  /usr/include/libfguid/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libfguid/error.h
  /usr/include/libfguid/extern.h
  /usr/include/libfguid/features.h
  /usr/include/libfguid/types.h
  /usr/lib/libfguid.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfguid.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libfguid.3.gz

